false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202608/content_7079223.htm","pubtime":1787751120000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"全民医保“十五五”规划发布 未来5年全面建成多层次医疗保障体系","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.08.20","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26519974","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"国家医保局8月19日发布《全民医疗保障“十五五”规划》（以下简称《规划》）。《规划》明确，将坚持以人民<em>健康</em>为中心，以推动医保事业高质量发展为主题，以改革创新为动力，坚持整体谋划、系统治理，尽力而为、","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202608/content_7078670.htm","pubtime":1787186880000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"治理中小企业回款难 这场吹风会深入解读","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.09.14","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26648639","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"推动落实？国新办14日举行国务院政策例行吹风会，介绍相关情况。 治理中小企业回款难问题事关中小企业<em>健康</em>发展、事关市场竞争环境优化、事关国民经济畅通循环。一段时间来，部分大型企业利用其市场竞争优势地位，","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202609/content_7081057.htm","pubtime":1789392600000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""}]},"gongbao":{"totalCount":3472,"catName":"gongbao","currentNum":10,"listVO":[{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"国务院关于印发《国民<em>健康</em>“十五五”规划》的通知<br/>　　国民<em>健康</em>“十五五”规划","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.07.30","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26420189","themeLinks":[],"ptime":1783414800000,"fcode":"","summary":"营养<em>健康</em>工程建设。鼓励发展特殊医学用途配方食品、保健食品。发展<em>健康</em><em>体检</em>等新型服务业态。促进慢性病管理、生活照护等方面智慧养老服务产品研发应用，发展康复辅助器具产业，提升康复疗养服务水平。推动医疗领域有序","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12886/202607/content_7076952.html","pubtime":1785402000000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"中华人民共和国民政部令（第83号）<br/>　　儿童福利机构管理办法","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.07.20","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26369706","themeLinks":[],"ptime":1770022800000,"fcode":"","summary":"　儿童福利机构接收儿童后，应当及时送医疗卫生机构进行<em>健康</em><em>体检</em>和传染病筛查。确实无法及时送医疗卫生机构的，应当先行隔离照料。 第十七条　儿童福利机构收留、抚养本办法第十条规定的儿童和第十二条第一款第一项","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12866/202607/content_7075900.html","pubtime":1784538000000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"中华人民共和国民政部令（第84号）<br/>　　未成年人救助保护机构管理暂行办法","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.07.30","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26420184","themeLinks":[],"ptime":1770022800000,"fcode":"","summary":"未成年人，应当按程序办理进入机构手续，并建立档案。 第十一条　未成年人救助保护机构接收未成年人后，应当及时送医疗卫生机构进行<em>健康</em><em>体检</em>和传染病筛查。确实无法及时送医疗卫生机构的，应当先行隔离照料。 第十二条","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12886/202607/content_7076948.html","pubtime":1785402000000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"国务院关于《扩大消费“十五五”规划》的批复","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.07.30","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26420185","themeLinks":[],"ptime":1782982800000,"fcode":"","summary":"支持有条件的医疗卫生机构开展医养结合服务。大力发展<em>健康</em><em>体检</em>、<em>健康</em>咨询、<em>健康</em>管理等新型服务业态。推动新一代信息技术和智能设备集成应用，推进“互联网+医疗<em>健康</em>”发展。持续完善中医药<em>健康</em>服务体系。 （六）鼓励","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12886/202607/content_7076951.html","pubtime":1785402000000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code